Package: CausalStress
Title: A Rigorous Benchmarking Framework Built on a
        Constitutional Architecture
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-07-24
Authors@R: person("Maximilian", "Thomasberger", , "max@blechturm.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A rigorous framework for benchmarking causal inference
        estimators under controlled conditions. It implements a
        "Constitutional" architecture that enforces strict data
        separation ("Airlocks") between estimators and ground truth,
        preventing registered estimators from receiving runner-owned
        truth columns. The package features atomic
        persistence for crash resilience, provenance tracking via Git
        hashes, and a standardized interface for comparing estimators
        across diverse synthetic data-generating processes.
